      "already_pushed": true,
      "text": "New trend I'm observing:\n\n1. Startup raises venture capital\n2. Uses venture dollars to become creator \n3. Startup fails\n4. Fall back on becoming a full-time creator and makes $500k-$5M/year as creator\n5. Incubates other products bootstrapped\n6. Never raises VC again",
      "text_zh": "我观察到的新趋势：\n\n1. 创业公司融到风险投资\n2. 用风投的钱把自己做成创作者\n3. 创业公司失败\n4. 退回去做全职创作者，一年靠创作赚 $500k-$5M\n5. 再用自举的方式孵化其他产品\n6. 再也不向 VC 融资",
